WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.650
Section 4: Section 504 Private Prosecution.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:15.087
Under Criminal Code section 504, any person with reasonable grounds to believe an indictable offence was committed may lay an information before a justice of the peace.

00:00:15.087 --> 00:00:17.425
This is not theoretical.

00:00:17.425 --> 00:00:26.212
This section walks through the four steps: gather evidence, draft the information, attend court, and follow the pre-enquiry hearing process.
